# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# sail/ Python package (docs/SAIL_PACKAGE_ROADMAP.md) -- build/test artifacts,
# never the package source itself.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Eleventy build — GitHub Actions builds this fresh on every push (see
# .github/workflows/deploy.yml). Never commit build output or node_modules.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
_site/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# MIMIC-IV governance — see DATA_ACCESS.md before removing anything below.
# Row-level / patient-level derived data must never be committed. results/ is
# blocked by default; only specific, hand-reviewed aggregate files under
# results/ are explicitly allowed back in via the negations at the bottom of
# this file (git evaluates rules in file order, so negations must come after
# every rule that could otherwise re-catch them — don't move these above the
# *.csv/*.parquet lines below).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
results/*
# The notebook's own working output directory (OUT_DIR in cell 3) -- separate from the curated
# top-level results/ folder above. Blocked entirely, no negation exceptions: everything written
# here is a full-cohort/full-decision-point extraction (row-level), never hand-reviewed for
# publication. If a file from here needs to be published, copy the aggregate to results/ instead
# of un-ignoring anything under this path.
notebook/results/
data/
*.csv
*.parquet
*.feather
# GCP / BigQuery credentials — never commit these regardless of data sensitivity
*.json.key
service-account*.json
.env
bigquery-credentials*

